message: >-
  If you refer to this work, please cite it as an unpublished manuscript using the
  metadata below. It has not been submitted to or accepted by any venue and has not
  been peer reviewed.
title: >-
  Flexible Intelligent Metasurfaces for High-Mobility ISAC: Hardware Evidence,
  Adaptation Timescales, and Validation Gaps
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility package for a structured critical review of flexible intelligent
  metasurfaces in high-mobility integrated sensing and communication. It contains the
  manuscript, the adaptation-stage and timing evidence registers behind it, the
  citation-traceability audit, and the scripts that reproduce the literature search
  and the consistency checks. The corpus PDFs themselves are not distributed.
